---
layout: base.njk
title: Research
---
{% from "macros.njk" import avatar %}
<div class="page-head">
  <div class="eyebrow">Research</div>
  <h1>Three core areas and a shared toolbox</h1>
  <p class="lede">CFP brings together theorists working on quantum materials, quantum field theory and gravitation. Many projects cross these boundaries, from lattice field theory to black holes in holography.</p>
</div>
<div class="area-list">
{% for a in areas %}{% set members = people | inArea(a.id) %}
  <article class="area-row" data-c="{{ a.color }}">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">{{ a.short }}</div>
      <h3><a href="/research/{{ a.id }}/">{{ a.name }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ a.summary }}</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      {% if a.topics.length %}<ul class="topics">{% for t in a.topics %}<li>{{ t.name }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
      <div class="faces">{% for p in members %}<span title="{{ p.name }}">{{ avatar(p) }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
      <div class="count-line">{{ members | length }} members</div>
    </div>
  </article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
